  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mOV5RKV.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"572\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p>本模组允许玩家重置村民的交易。模组会在村民交易界面中添加一个重置按钮，用于重新生成交易。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>请注意，您只能重置尚未产生经验的村民的交易。如果村民之前已被交易过并产生了经验，重置按钮将不会显示！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>如果在服务器上游玩，此模组也必须安装在服务器上！</strong></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz 合作伙伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器？使用优惠码“mrbysco”首月立减20%！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有问题，欢迎加入我的 Discord 频道。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord 链接\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想要支持我们吗？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
